      "body": "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<rss version=\"2.0\" xmlns:dc=\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\" xmlns:atom=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom\">\n<channel>\n<atom:link href=\"https://www.nhc.noaa.gov/gtwo.xml\" rel=\"self\" type=\"application/rss+xml\" />\n<pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 14:50:14 UTC</pubDate>\n<lastBuildDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 14:50:14 UTC</lastBuildDate>\n<title>National Hurricane Center Graphical Tropical Weather Outlooks</title>\n<description>National Hurricane Center Graphical Tropical Weather Outlooks</description>\n<link>https://www.nhc.noaa.gov/</link>\n<copyright>none</copyright>\n<managingEditor>nhcwebmaster@noaa.gov (NHC Webmaster)</managingEditor>\n<language>en-us</language>\n<webMaster>nhcwebmaster@noaa.gov (NHC Webmaster)</webMaster>\n<image>\n<url>https://www.nhc.noaa.gov/images/xml_logo_nhc.gif</url>\n<link>https://www.nhc.noaa.gov/</link>\n<title>National Hurricane Center Graphical Tropical Weather Outlooks</title>\n<description>NOAA logo</description>\n<width>95</width>\n<height>45</height>\n</image>\n<item>\n<title>Atlantic Tropical Weather Outlook</title>\n<description>\n<![CDATA[\n<br /><a href=\"https://www.nhc.noaa.gov/gtwo.php?basin=atlc&amp;fdays=2\">\n<img src=\"https://www.nhc.noaa.gov/xgtwo/resize/xgtwo_atl_2d0_w400.png\" alt=\"Atlantic 2-Day Graphical Outlook Image\" width=\"400\" height=\"302\" /></a>\n<br /><a href=\"https://www.nhc.noaa.gov/gtwo.php?basin=atlc&amp;fdays=7\">\n<img src=\"https://www.nhc.noaa.gov/xgtwo/resize/xgtwo_atl_7d0_w400.png\" alt=\"Atlantic 7-Day Graphical Outlook Image\" width=\"400\" height=\"302\" /></a>\n<br /><br />\n<div class='textbackground'><div class='textproduct'><br />\n000<br>ABNT20 KNHC 171135<br>TWOAT <br><br>Tropical Weather Outlook<br>NWS National Hurricane Center Miami FL<br>800 AM EDT Sat Oct 17 2026<br><br>For the North Atlantic...Caribbean Sea and the Gulf of America:<br><br>Tropical cyclone formation is not expected during the next 7 days.<br><br>$$<br>Forecaster Beven<br><br></div></div><br />\n]]>\n</description>\n<pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 11:35:41 UTC</pubDate>\n<link>https://www.nhc.noaa.gov/gtwo.php?basin=atlc</link>\n<guid>https://www.nhc.noaa.gov/gtwo.php?basin=atlc&amp;202610171135</guid>\n<author>nhcwebmaster@noaa.gov (NHC Webmaster)</author>\n</item>\n<item>\n<title>Eastern Pacific Tropical Weather Outlook</title>\n<description>\n<![CDATA[\n<br /><a href=\"https://www.nhc.noaa.gov/gtwo.php?basin=epac&amp;fdays=2\">\n<img src=\"https://www.nhc.noaa.gov/xgtwo/resize/xgtwo_pac_2d0_w400.png\" alt=\"Eastern North Pacific 2-Day Graphical Outlook Image\" width=\"400\" height=\"302\" /></a>\n<br /><a href=\"https://www.nhc.noaa.gov/gtwo.php?basin=epac&amp;fdays=7\">\n<img src=\"https://www.nhc.noaa.gov/xgtwo/resize/xgtwo_pac_7d0_w400.png\" alt=\"Eastern North Pacific 7-Day Graphical Outlook Image\" width=\"400\" height=\"302\" /></a>\n<br /><br />\n<div class='textbackground'><div class='textproduct'><br />\n855 <br>ABPZ20 KNHC 171138<br>TWOEP <br><br>Tropical Weather Outlook<br>NWS National Hurricane Center Miami FL<br>500 AM PDT Sat Oct 17 2026<br><br>For the eastern and central North Pacific east of 180 longitude:<br><br>Active Systems:<br>The National Hurricane Center is issuing advisories on Hurricane <br>Trudy, located a couple of hundred miles west-southwest of Acapulco, <br>Mexico.<br><br>South of Southern Mexico:<br>An area of low pressure is forecast to form offshore of southern <br>Mexico during the early to middle part of next week. Environmental <br>conditions appear conducive for gradual development thereafter, and <br>a tropical depression is likely to form during the latter half of <br>next week while it moves generally westward to west-northwestward <br>over the eastern and central portions of the East Pacific. <br>* Formation chance through 48 hours...low...near 0 percent. <br>* Formation chance through 7 days...high...70 percent.<br><br>$$<br>Forecaster Adams<br><br></div></div><br />\n]]>\n</description>\n<pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 11:38:08 UTC</pubDate>\n<link>https://www.nhc.noaa.gov/gtwo.php?basin=epac</link>\n<guid>https://www.nhc.noaa.gov/gtwo.php?basin=epac&amp;202610171138</guid>\n<author>nhcwebmaster@noaa.gov (NHC Webmaster)</author>\n</item>\n<item>\n<title>Central Pacific Tropical Weather Outlook</title>\n<description>\n<![CDATA[\n<br /><a href=\"https://www.nhc.noaa.gov/gtwo.php?basin=cpac&amp;fdays=2\">\n<img src=\"https://www.nhc.noaa.gov/xgtwo/resize/xgtwo_cpac_2d0_w400.png\" alt=\"Central North Pacific 2-Day Graphical Outlook Image\" width=\"400\" height=\"302\" /></a>\n<br /><a href=\"https://www.nhc.noaa.gov/gtwo.php?basin=cpac&amp;fdays=7\">\n<img src=\"https://www.nhc.noaa.gov/xgtwo/resize/xgtwo_cpac_7d0_w400.png\" alt=\"Central North Pacific 7-Day Graphical Outlook Image\" width=\"400\" height=\"302\" /></a>\n<br /><br />\n<div class='textbackground'><div class='textproduct'><br />\n000<br>ACPN50 PHFO 171138<br>TWOCP <br><br>Tropical Weather Outlook<br>NWS Central Pacific Hurricane Center Honolulu HI<br>Issued by NWS National Hurricane Center Miami FL<br>200 AM HST Sat Oct 17 2026<br><br>For the central North Pacific...between 140W and 180W:<br><br>Active Systems:<br>The National Hurricane Center is issuing advisories on Hurricane<br>Trudy, located a couple of hundred miles west-southwest of Acapulco,<br>Mexico.<br><br>Tropical cyclone formation is not expected during the next 7 days.<br><br>$$<br>Forecaster Adams<br>NNNN<br><br></div></div><br />\n]]>\n</description>\n<pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 11:38:07 UTC</pubDate>\n<link>https://www.nhc.noaa.gov/gtwo.php?basin=cpac</link>\n<guid>https://www.nhc.noaa.gov/gtwo.php?basin=cpac&amp;202610171138</guid>\n<author>nhcwebmaster@noaa.gov (NHC Webmaster)</author>\n</item>\n</channel>\n</rss>\n"
